WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.814
Account aur privacy: yahan apna password badlein.

00:00:05.914 --> 00:00:13.091
Owners ke liye two-step sign-in zaroori hai: authenticator app ka code, aur recovery codes.

00:00:13.192 --> 00:00:19.093
Sabhi devices se logout, apna data download aur accept kiye terms dekhein.
